For Amazon Linux

Install and setup eksctl on Management Host   
   a. Download and extract the latest release   
   b. Move the extracted binary to /usr/local/bin   
   c. Test that your eksclt installation was successful   
   ```sh
   curl --silent --location "https://github.com/weaveworks/eksctl/releases/latest/download/eksctl_$(uname -s)_amd64.tar.gz" | tar xz -C /tmp
sudo mv /home/ubuntu/eksctl /usr/local/bin
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/eksctl
eksctl version

* For Ubuntu Linux
curl -sLO "https://github.com/eksctl-io/eksctl/releases/latest/download/eksctl_$(uname -s)_amd64.tar.gz"
tar -xzf eksctl_$(uname -s)_amd64.tar.gz
ls -l eksctl
sudo mv eksctl /usr/local/bin/
eksctl version


* For Mac

curl --silent --location "https://github.com/weaveworks/eksctl/releases/download/v0.143.0/eksctl_$(uname -s)_amd64.tar.gz" | tar xz -C /tmp

sudo mv /tmp/eksctl /usr/local/bin
eksctl version
